<title>SINGAPORE: Flextech sets up U.S. depository receipt.</title>
<headline>Flextech sets up U.S. depository receipt.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flextech Holdings Ltd said on Friday it has established a sponsored Level One American Depositary Receipt (ADR) programme in the U.S. to facilitate its share trading there.</p>
<p>The electronics and industrial distributor said in a statement the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission has given its approval for the establishment of the ADR programme, which will be launched with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The Bank of New York has been appointed as the depository, with its Singapore branch acting as the custodian.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
